1795236203174	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-4765097468300979381"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:23.174-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:23.175-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-smallpox2"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pinned"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Published Articles"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"नेपालमा बिफरको इतिहास (भाग २): शीतला माजु, बिफरको पात्रो र दरबारको ढोकामा आएको खोप जनतासम्म पुग्न लागेको एक सय उनान्साठी वर्ष"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"यो लेख पहिलो पटक २०८३ असोज १६ गते शिलापत्रमा “बासभ : समयको उत्खनन” स्तम्भमा प्रकाशित भएको थियो। शिलापत्रमा प्रकाशित लेखको हेडर । बिफरको नेपाली इतिहासबारे पहिलो भागमासन् १७९९ को सुरुमा काठमाडौँमा फैलिएको बिफरले राजा रणबहादुर शाहकी सबैभन्दा प्रिय रानी कान्तिवतीलाई पनि भेटायो। रणबहादुरले डेढ वर्ष नपुगेका छोरा गिर्वाणयुद्धलाई राजा घोषणा गरे। आफू स्वामी निर्गुणानन्द बनेर देवपाटनमा रानीको हेरचाहमा लागे।"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/4765097468300979381/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/bifar-nepali-itihas-bhag-2-khop.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4765097468300979381"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4765097468300979381"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/bifar-nepali-itihas-bhag-2-khop.html","title":"नेपालमा बिफरको इतिहास (भाग २): शीतला माजु,